/megalinter-reports

# The two helper programs the LB tests run, built by 'make -C LB/tests' from the .c
# files that are tracked next to them.
LB/tests/testSocket
LB/tests/JSON_checker
LB/tests/*.o

# Scratch the test scripts write into their own directory while they run: the error
# accumulation file each one opens as $$.err, the temporaries and dumps they name after
# their process, and the listings a check compares permissions against. run.sh needs a
# writable checkout for exactly this reason.
*.err
*.tmp
*.out
*_notifications*.txt
*.*.[0-9]*
LB/tests/644or664glite
LB/tests/cms-*.json
